From: SEGURIDAD-PORTES-28 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:58:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] v8: four Chrome 158 Low fixes (0b3bd2b, 336a6b3, fb3bcc3,
 0ac2b27)

FlyWeb 3.1.4 part 6 (Chrome 158 Lows). New patches/v8 for:
- 0b3bd2b [inspector] Restrict Runtime.getHeapUsage and
  Runtime.getIsolateId to fully trusted clients (crbug 553263303).
- 336a6b3 [inspector] Don't store raw pointers in the deep serialization
  dedup map (crbug 568986689).
- fb3bcc3 [inspector] Avoid v8::Array for V8Console data (crbug 572312093).
- 0ac2b27 [maglev] Use static constant in StringLengthStaticLowerBound
  (crbug 574412712).

kFlyWebCacheEpoch 35 -> 36 (0ac2b27 changes optimized code). Details in
patches/v8/FLYWEB-SECURITY.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MwmK2iFqX7G9w939C4tEtH
